"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087680/extras/fee33d09005ae602ea77f51dabca2b2a.poster.avif?t=1727470306\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087680/extras/fee33d09005ae602ea77f51dabca2b2a.webm?t=1727470306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087680/extras/fee33d09005ae602ea77f51dabca2b2a.mp4?t=1727470306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game does not contain jumpscare! But that doesn't mean that you won't feel afraid, or be scared by something while playing, everything was designed to leave you frightened and tense.<br><br>Avarage gameplay time: 40 min",
